# The UE5 mannequin on its own idle (UAL2), the runner's chest and head hits
# retargeted from its file as layers added over the whole figure, each
# played once when the game raises it (the showcase's hit figure).
take idle Idle_No_Loop
take hit_chest Hit_Chest from tests/fixtures/people/ual1_rigify.glb
take hit_head Hit_Head from tests/fixtures/people/ual1_rigify.glb
state idle idle loop
layer hit_chest hit_chest additive once
layer hit_head hit_head additive once
play idle
